phobia-unspecified-name = Unnamed
phobia-unspecified-description = Fear hovers on the edge of your consciousness. You do not understand its cause.
exoremophobia-name = Exoremophobia
exoremophobia-description = You cannot bear the thought that they are real. They do not breathe and do not live, yet they exist as though somewhere between the pieces of our world. The reality of these beings fills you with terror.
necrophobia-name = Necrophobia
necrophobia-description = The sight of a dead body sends shivers down your spine. It is as if corpses know you are alive and are about to open their eyes.
hemophobia-name = Hemophobia
hemophobia-description = Blood causes nausea and panic. Even a drop of blood on the floor can make you believe it is the end.
